# Examples

Runnable demonstration scripts for ootk. Each script is embedded, section by
section, in the VitePress documentation site (`docs/examples/`), so keep the
`// #region` markers intact when editing: the docs pages reference them by name.

The scripts import from `'ootk'`, which resolves to the built `dist/` output via
npm package self-reference. Build once, then run any example with tsx:

```bash
npm run build
npx tsx ./examples/satellite-passes.ts
```

Browse the annotated versions with explanations and expected output:

```bash
npm run docs:dev
```

then open the Examples section.
